# Questions of Access in the Digital Humanities: Data from JDSH

**Authors:** Ernesto Priego

## Abstract
<p>I used The Altmetric Explorer to locate any articles from the Journal of Digital Scholarlship in the Humanities that had had any ‘mentions’ online anytime. With the Open Access Button API we tried to locate open surrogates. Some insights are shared from the data.</p>

